SpeedFan & SpeedFan Engine
--------------------------
Original Author & Copyright Holder: Alfredo Milani Comparetti (Almico Software)
Official Website: http://www.almico.com/speedfan.php

This project utilizes the SpeedFan engine and driver components (including 
speedfan.exe, speedfan.sys, sfextra.dll, and instspeedfan.exe) to communicate 
with motherboard SuperIO hardware monitor chips (such as ITE, Nuvoton, Winbond, 
and Fintek) across diverse PC motherboards.

All intellectual property rights, trademarks, copyrights, and ownership of 
SpeedFan and its driver components remain exclusively with their original author, 
Alfredo Milani Comparetti.

SpeedFan is used in this non-commercial, open-source community project with the 
utmost respect and deepest gratitude for Alfredo Milani Comparetti's pioneering 
contributions to hardware monitoring and fan control on the Windows platform. 
We kindly request and appreciate permission to utilize these components solely to 
provide safe cooling solutions for headless AMD Instinct MI50 and Radeon PRO VII 
hardware.

If the author or copyright holder of SpeedFan wishes for these components to be 
modified, updated, or removed from this repository at any time, please contact 
the project maintainer (https://github.com/kingbone2006/MI50-Fan-Control), and we 
will promptly comply.

